 <p class="lead">Proven marketing performance. Real-world sales experience. Both working toward the same goal: more profitable jobs.</p>
 <p class="grp">Operator experience</p>
 <p class="prov">Our founder built and led an automotive dealership's sales department for 27 months, developing the systems for lead response, appointment setting, follow-up, and closing. The results below come from that operation and were documented in monthly performance reports.</p>
 <div class="stats"><div><b>11,564</b><span>Leads worked</span></div><div><b>2,135</b><span>Appointments shown</span></div><div><b>761</b><span>Sales closed</span></div><div><b class="o">35.6%</b><span>Show-to-sale</span></div><div><b>$34M+</b><span>Closed revenue</span></div></div>
 <p class="travel">35.6% is the share of shown appointments that bought, in automotive sales, not HVAC. <b>The method is what travels</b>: response speed, show rate, close rate. A comfort visit is a sales appointment too.</p>
